  "details": "When hiding a friend's location in the 'Friend Locations' section of the Social Menu, various errors can occur. These include other friends incorrectly appearing as if they are in the same world/instance when they are not (which can be temporarily fixed by scrolling away and back again), the hidden friend showing as 'in a private instance' or incorrectly appearing in the same world/instance as another person and profile images breaking in the menu, among others.\n\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/1tx0d0.mp4",
